<title>NETHERLANDS: KNP BT to raise paper prices by 10 pct.</title>
<headline>KNP BT to raise paper prices by 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch paper, packagings and office equipment group KNP BT said on Monday its paper division KNP Leykam would raise prices of woodfree coated paper in Belgium and the Netherlands by about 10 percent in September.  </p>
<p>&quot;This price rise is necessary given the continuing increase of the group's raw material costs in particular,&quot; KNP said in a statement.</p>
<p>It added it would also raise prices for wood-based coated paper in the second half of this year but did not elaborate.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
